1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 29]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:35,820
[Li's Residence]

4
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,450
Fifth Master!

5
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:47,100
Master just told me to invite you over.

6
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:47,820
Follow me, please.

7
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,570
Master, Fifth Master is here.

8
00:02:59,590 --> 00:03:00,820
You're here, Laogou.

9
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,820
Fifth Master, go ahead.

10
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,010
The Ministry of War has already

11
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:08,410
planted informants in the Mystic Nine.

12
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,220
Laogou.

13
00:03:12,470 --> 00:03:13,170
You're here.

14
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:14,570
What a coincidence.

15
00:03:14,710 --> 00:03:15,830
I just told my man to invite you,

16
00:03:15,830 --> 00:03:16,730
and here you are.

17
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,410
Come. Take a seat.

18
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:19,890
Come.

19
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:22,010
Take a seat.

20
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:24,820
Take a seat.

21
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:25,890
I brought a pot of liquor.

22
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:28,260
Let's calm our nerves.

23
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:29,290
Sure.

24
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:30,820
Let's calm our nerves.

25
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:32,290
Pour it.

26
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:37,940
I suppose the Ministry of War spares us now

27
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,570
because they are still looking for an excuse.

28
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:44,450
They don't want a riot in Changsha

29
00:03:44,710 --> 00:03:45,690
or to antagonize the Mystic Nine.

30
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:49,130
We are free now.

31
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,100
That's probably because someone

32
00:03:51,470 --> 00:03:52,500
has set a plan in motion.

33
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,290
Who do you think did that?

34
00:03:59,190 --> 00:04:00,500
Xie Jiu or Master Zhang?

35
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:06,570
Who knows?

36
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,260
Third Master.

37
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,820
What is your next move?

38
00:04:15,710 --> 00:04:16,580
Lay low.

39
00:04:17,750 --> 00:04:18,700
But heed my advice.

40
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,660
At this juncture,

41
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:23,140
trust

42
00:04:23,390 --> 00:04:24,580
no one.

43
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,370
Come.

44
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,250
Come.

45
00:04:30,830 --> 00:04:31,340
A toast to you.

46
00:04:38,390 --> 00:04:39,140
You'll drink first.

47
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:41,780
What is the meaning of this?

48
00:04:45,310 --> 00:04:47,540
I fear you have poisoned the liquor.

49
00:05:16,430 --> 00:05:17,900
What are you on about?

50
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,020
Are you already drunk before you drink?

51
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,370
Laogou is our friend.

52
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:27,170
When I had a labor complication back then,

53
00:05:27,950 --> 00:05:28,700
Laogou

54
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,780
and Xie Jiu were there to help me.

55
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,850
That's how I survived.

56
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,490
I won't forget

57
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,050
this kindness from you.

58
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:39,170
You two have known each other for many years.

59
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,460
You can

60
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,610
overcome this obstacle

61
00:05:43,390 --> 00:05:44,410
and live well.

62
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,540
Trust me.

63
00:05:47,390 --> 00:05:49,730
Stay alive, and you'll find a way out.

64
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,140
Yes.

65
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,020
Staying alive is the most important part.

66
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:02,780
I'm sorry.

67
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:05,930
Laogou.

68
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,290
Cheers.

69
00:06:16,830 --> 00:06:17,700
Only these two dishes?

70
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,930
Make two more dishes.

71
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,370
Sure.

72
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:27,020
Two more dishes.

73
00:06:28,510 --> 00:06:29,290
Enjoy

74
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,220
the liquor.

75
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:42,700
Laogou.

76
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,980
I need a favor from you.

77
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:49,850
Consider it my debt to you.

78
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,340
Sure, Third Master.

79
00:06:58,390 --> 00:06:59,730
Tonight,

80
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:01,930
at dusk,

81
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,980
bring my wife and my son with you

82
00:07:06,630 --> 00:07:07,050
and leave.

83
00:07:09,070 --> 00:07:10,370
What are you planning to do?

84
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:14,980
I'm crippled. I can't run far.

85
00:07:15,310 --> 00:07:17,810
There are enemies within and outside the city.

86
00:07:18,630 --> 00:07:19,900
They want our lives

87
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:20,930
and the Mystic Nine.

88
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:22,580
But the woman and the kid

89
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,540
are innocent.

90
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:28,780
Throughout my life,

91
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:30,250
I've only trusted my blade, my account ledger,

92
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,660
and you.

93
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,580
Because you

94
00:07:34,630 --> 00:07:35,850
gave my son

95
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,410
his life.

96
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,410
Third Master.

97
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:43,140
The Ministry of War

98
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,850
spied on me as I came here.

99
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,580
I might die anytime soon.

100
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:47,810
If I have to take care of your son as well,

101
00:07:47,830 --> 00:07:48,170
isn't that...

102
00:07:49,270 --> 00:07:49,850
But I know

103
00:07:49,870 --> 00:07:51,410
you're not one who runs away from responsibilities.

104
00:07:53,630 --> 00:07:54,580
Besides,

105
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:56,250
you're my son's godfather.

106
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,290
I'm begging you now.

107
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:14,540
Who would have thought

108
00:08:15,630 --> 00:08:16,490
that the Third Master

109
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,050
of the Mystic Nine would beg someone one day?

110
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:30,580
Changsha

111
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,610
isn't what it used to be.

112
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,060
The Mystic Nine

113
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,060
is also not what it used to be.

114
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:41,610
However,

115
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:43,940
as long as I live,

116
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,490
you can rest assured

117
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,490
about your wife and your son's safety.

118
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,220
The food is ready!

119
00:09:20,670 --> 00:09:21,770
Li!

120
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:28,530
Wu Laogou!

121
00:09:28,790 --> 00:09:29,980
You scoundrel!

122
00:09:30,390 --> 00:09:31,580
I'll kill you.

123
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,010
I'll kill you!

124
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:50,250
Fifth Master.

125
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:54,130
What is going on?

126
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,100
Why are you covered in blood?

127
00:09:57,750 --> 00:09:58,220
Fifth Master.

128
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,340
What happened?

129
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,250
It's not mine.

130
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,820
It's Chen Pi's,

131
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,610
Heibei's,

132
00:10:15,510 --> 00:10:16,730
and Li's blood.

133
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:19,770
I

134
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,100
demolished the Mystic Nine.

135
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:27,490
What?

136
00:10:29,270 --> 00:10:30,010
Xiangu.

137
00:10:44,910 --> 00:10:45,730
It'll be fine.

138
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:11,380
♪See the moon, indelible as ink♪

139
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:14,900
♪As red plum blossoms fall along the street♪

140
00:11:15,260 --> 00:11:18,660
♪Who turns back with a troubled frown?♪

141
00:11:19,180 --> 00:11:23,980
♪See the sky lanterns rise and fall♪

142
00:11:24,220 --> 00:11:27,180
♪If I could take one bright thread from memory♪

143
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:31,900
♪I'd keep its lingering sweetness in my heart♪

144
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,890
Must I

145
00:11:33,910 --> 00:11:34,980
be this cruel?

146
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:38,060
You need to convince the Ministry of War

147
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,890
that you are driven by self-interest,

148
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:42,890
and that you take over the Mystic Nine violently.

149
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:47,540
♪I drink a cup of rough wine♪

150
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:52,700
♪Right and wrong pass with the changing seasons♪

151
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:57,100
♪My heart unchanged, I have no regrets♪

152
00:11:57,100 --> 00:12:02,460
♪However the past may have twisted and turned, I regret nothing with you♪

153
00:12:03,340 --> 00:12:09,620
♪When a thousand sails ride wind and waves home, I'll sail with you again♪

154
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:16,020
♪When flowers fall and you return, I wish time could turn back♪

155
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:22,220
♪I'll share with you the lingering taste of new wine♪

156
00:12:22,820 --> 00:12:24,660
♪And get drunk with you♪

157
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:33,050
♪I♪

158
00:12:35,130 --> 00:12:37,500
♪Will turn the Heavenly Palace upside down♪

159
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:38,780
[Shared Legacy of Mystic Nine]

160
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:44,230
♪100,000 Heavenly Soldiers♪

161
00:12:47,590 --> 00:12:49,140
I am Wu Laogou.

162
00:12:49,590 --> 00:12:51,100
A dog breeder.

163
00:12:51,990 --> 00:12:52,820
From now on,

164
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:55,780
[Fifth]
I am the Fifth Master.

165
00:12:55,880 --> 00:13:00,500
♪I am the Monkey King!♪

166
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,890
♪I laugh boisterously♪

167
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:13,420
♪Open up!♪

168
00:14:00,030 --> 00:14:02,840
- Breaking news! - Breaking news!

169
00:14:02,840 --> 00:14:04,940
- Eryue Hong was badly burnt!
- One newspaper, please.

170
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:07,610
- Banjie Li was mortally wounded.
- One newspaper.

171
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,530
- Blood has been spilled!
- One newspaper.

172
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:12,420
- Wu Laogou turned on his own!
- Let me read it.

173
00:14:12,670 --> 00:14:13,820
[Mystic Nine in War]
Young boy, give me one.

174
00:14:13,900 --> 00:14:14,500
[Eryue Hong]

175
00:14:14,500 --> 00:14:15,380
[Laogou]

176
00:14:15,380 --> 00:14:16,220
[Mortally wounded]

177
00:14:16,220 --> 00:14:17,460
[Crippled]

178
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,490
Why did you do that?

179
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,220
Why?

180
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,460
Why?

181
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:22,340
Master.

182
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:28,420
Sir.

183
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,250
Huo Wenhai

184
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,420
must have noticed

185
00:15:58,720 --> 00:15:59,770
that we had met the other day.

186
00:16:00,150 --> 00:16:01,340
So he took the risk

187
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:03,010
[Changsha Defense Headquarters]
and stole the military seal.

188
00:16:03,790 --> 00:16:05,180
He tried to instigate a rebellion.

189
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,650
Fortunately, your perceptive adjutant

190
00:16:19,030 --> 00:16:19,770
picked up the signs

191
00:16:20,510 --> 00:16:21,370
and went in alone

192
00:16:21,870 --> 00:16:23,370
to kill Huo Wenhai.

193
00:16:24,390 --> 00:16:25,100
Unfortunately,

194
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,490
he lost his life to the cause.

195
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:28,490
That said,

196
00:16:29,270 --> 00:16:30,250
I've written to the higher-ups

197
00:16:31,270 --> 00:16:32,250
and requested that they

198
00:16:32,270 --> 00:16:33,580
give him the title of Army Captain.

199
00:16:35,790 --> 00:16:37,340
He did not care about the title.

200
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:38,770
I know.

201
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:41,460
He was not doing this for the title,

202
00:16:42,390 --> 00:16:43,370
but you.

203
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:47,340
Huo Wenhai

204
00:16:47,790 --> 00:16:48,610
is dead.

205
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:51,460
That saved us a lot of trouble.

206
00:16:54,550 --> 00:16:56,060
I have already signed the document

207
00:16:56,150 --> 00:16:57,730
appointing you as the special commissioner

208
00:16:58,630 --> 00:16:59,770
to eliminate the Mystic Nine.

209
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:01,650
It's on your desk.

210
00:17:02,870 --> 00:17:04,770
I've given you the direction.

211
00:17:05,550 --> 00:17:06,700
Qishan, I hope you know

212
00:17:07,270 --> 00:17:07,810
what

213
00:17:08,830 --> 00:17:10,330
to do.

214
00:17:12,310 --> 00:17:15,620
Nevertheless, I don't think the "kill six to save three" plan

215
00:17:17,350 --> 00:17:18,490
will work.

216
00:17:24,590 --> 00:17:25,770
Wu Laogou

217
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,290
took over the Mystic Nine

218
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:29,050
when it was at its most vulnerable.

219
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,180
He was ruthless

220
00:17:31,310 --> 00:17:32,250
and killed many people.

221
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:33,900
In the entirety of Changsha,

222
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:34,530
he is

223
00:17:34,750 --> 00:17:36,090
the biggest underground force.

224
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:40,860
Read it.

225
00:17:42,270 --> 00:17:43,050
Today's newspaper.

226
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:48,690
[Breaking News: The Mystic Nine Might be No More]

227
00:17:48,690 --> 00:17:49,790
[Wu Laogou killed everyone in the Mystic Nine]

228
00:17:49,790 --> 00:17:51,220
A thug is a thug.

229
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,810
You can't change his bloodthirsty nature.

230
00:17:54,790 --> 00:17:55,810
We can't spare someone

231
00:17:56,110 --> 00:17:56,810
like Wu Laogou.

232
00:17:59,830 --> 00:18:00,530
I remember

233
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,770
you two have a feud.

234
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:04,940
Killing him

235
00:18:05,270 --> 00:18:06,620
should be easy for you, right?

236
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:19,730
Qishan.

237
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:22,460
Your world is more than just Changsha.

238
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,730
This place is huge,

239
00:18:25,350 --> 00:18:26,940
but it's insignificant in the grand scheme of things.

240
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:28,770
A war is upon us.

241
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,420
If you do this well,

242
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:34,460
I'll nominate you to the Ministry of War.

243
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:35,770
And then,

244
00:18:36,790 --> 00:18:38,250
you'll have a stage to shine.

245
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,770
We've been friends for many years.

246
00:18:45,070 --> 00:18:46,050
I hope

247
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,570
we can fight together in the future.

248
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:00,220
You have three days.

249
00:19:01,310 --> 00:19:01,900
After three days,

250
00:19:02,440 --> 00:19:03,420
I'll leave Changsha

251
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:04,860
for Hengyang for a conference.

252
00:19:06,590 --> 00:19:07,420
Zhang Qishan.

253
00:19:08,070 --> 00:19:09,570
Seize this opportunity.

254
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:11,250
Otherwise,

255
00:19:11,830 --> 00:19:12,460
it'll be

256
00:19:13,270 --> 00:19:14,940
too late for you to regret it.

257
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:31,140
[Appoint Zhang Qishan as Special Commissioner]

258
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:44,380
Master.

259
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:45,860
Fifth...

260
00:19:49,480 --> 00:19:50,010
Wu Laogou

261
00:19:51,070 --> 00:19:52,250
did turn on

262
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,050
the Mystic Nine.

263
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:58,050
The newspaper described his crime in a few words,

264
00:19:59,270 --> 00:19:59,980
but the reality

265
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,220
is much worse.

266
00:20:04,750 --> 00:20:05,570
Second Master's late wife

267
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:07,380
was burned.

268
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:09,770
Third Master was stabbed to death.

269
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,460
Fourth Master was rendered blind.

270
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:13,050
Sixth Master was cut many times.

271
00:20:13,830 --> 00:20:14,940
No one knows his fate.

272
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,770
Even Miss Huo was...

273
00:20:18,070 --> 00:20:18,810
Even Miss Huo

274
00:20:18,830 --> 00:20:19,570
was not spared.

275
00:20:21,350 --> 00:20:22,420
He removed her spine.

276
00:20:23,830 --> 00:20:25,420
She probably can't walk anymore.

277
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:28,140
A scheme.

278
00:20:30,240 --> 00:20:31,180
It's all part of his scheme.

279
00:20:34,270 --> 00:20:35,380
Be it Xiaoyu

280
00:20:37,070 --> 00:20:38,050
or Laogou,

281
00:20:40,070 --> 00:20:41,420
they all fell for Xie Jiu's scheme.

282
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,050
Why couldn't anyone

283
00:20:50,070 --> 00:20:51,180
believe me?

284
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:54,290
I already said

285
00:20:55,590 --> 00:20:57,180
I could save them all

286
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:01,090
with my life.

287
00:21:02,030 --> 00:21:02,570
Master!

288
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:03,860
Master,

289
00:21:04,070 --> 00:21:04,900
you know

290
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:06,810
very well that they believed what you said.

291
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,660
They knew

292
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,770
that you would carry the burden alone,

293
00:21:11,640 --> 00:21:12,330
so they

294
00:21:13,590 --> 00:21:14,810
had to stop you.

295
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:22,810
Where is Laogou?

296
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:24,770
In his dog farm, probably.

297
00:21:28,350 --> 00:21:28,860
Get the car ready.

298
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:05,290
Eighth Master inherited this from his ancestors.

299
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:08,290
He said it was the only copy left.

300
00:22:09,750 --> 00:22:10,460
He cherished it

301
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,730
more than he cherished his life.

302
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:30,330
Master.

303
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:31,620
Master Zhang...

304
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:33,180
Master Zhang is here.

305
00:22:36,240 --> 00:22:37,140
The inevitable

306
00:22:38,590 --> 00:22:39,570
has arrived.

307
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:03,810
Move aside.

308
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:27,220
Laogou.

309
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:31,250
What are you planning to achieve?

310
00:23:39,640 --> 00:23:40,860
Look who's here.

311
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:43,810
The head of the Mystic Nine

312
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:46,330
or the Changsha Defense Commander?

313
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:49,460
Whatever you plan is,

314
00:23:50,790 --> 00:23:51,380
share it with me.

315
00:23:52,270 --> 00:23:53,220
We work together,

316
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,380
and maybe, we can both get out of this alive.

317
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:00,700
You promised me

318
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:03,010
that you would leave the Mystic Nine

319
00:24:04,270 --> 00:24:05,330
as long as I find Unit 401.

320
00:24:07,030 --> 00:24:07,620
Have you forgotten?

321
00:24:10,750 --> 00:24:12,180
Since you're not part of the Mystic Nine,

322
00:24:13,110 --> 00:24:14,290
then you are a commander,

323
00:24:14,920 --> 00:24:16,620
and I am a bandit.

324
00:24:18,070 --> 00:24:19,980
There's nothing we can talk about.

325
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:21,420
See them off.

326
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:33,180
You waited for me

327
00:24:34,270 --> 00:24:35,180
to come here.

328
00:24:36,790 --> 00:24:38,050
Even if I leave the Mystic Nine,

329
00:24:40,030 --> 00:24:41,090
we both know

330
00:24:42,550 --> 00:24:43,460
that

331
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:46,380
we still need to sort things out in person.

332
00:24:48,550 --> 00:24:48,940
Okay.

333
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,570
I'll allow that.

334
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:54,490
I took over the Mystic Nine.

335
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:56,900
We both

336
00:24:58,070 --> 00:24:59,330
have a score to settle.

337
00:25:05,790 --> 00:25:06,770
Wait for me here.

338
00:25:07,880 --> 00:25:08,420
Yes.

339
00:25:22,310 --> 00:25:23,130
We've been through

340
00:25:25,080 --> 00:25:26,490
so many things all these years.

341
00:25:27,830 --> 00:25:29,460
You think I don't know what you're doing?

342
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:31,490
You went out of your way

343
00:25:32,480 --> 00:25:33,490
to usurp

344
00:25:33,760 --> 00:25:34,740
the other clans.

345
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:37,300
You want people to think

346
00:25:38,040 --> 00:25:39,020
that you

347
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:41,100
have taken over the Mystic Nine.

348
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:46,530
What is your plan?

349
00:25:47,320 --> 00:25:48,780
I need to know everything.

350
00:25:51,510 --> 00:25:53,100
The truth is,

351
00:25:54,870 --> 00:25:56,250
other than you, everyone in the Mystic Nine

352
00:25:57,870 --> 00:25:59,020
has to die.

353
00:26:01,360 --> 00:26:02,210
Xie Jiu told you that?

354
00:26:04,630 --> 00:26:05,570
There was never

355
00:26:05,590 --> 00:26:06,570
a "kill six to save three" plan.

356
00:26:07,710 --> 00:26:09,100
It was all to convince Luo Ang.

357
00:26:09,910 --> 00:26:10,970
The real plan

358
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:13,980
has always been to kill eight to save one.

359
00:26:15,350 --> 00:26:15,770
Master Zhang.

360
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:18,250
You already know that,

361
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:19,860
don't you?

362
00:26:30,310 --> 00:26:31,290
The Ministry of War

363
00:26:31,310 --> 00:26:32,420
will never spare those three clans.

364
00:26:33,590 --> 00:26:34,290
On the surface,

365
00:26:34,960 --> 00:26:36,730
they can spare the women and the opera performer.

366
00:26:37,310 --> 00:26:38,180
But in reality,

367
00:26:39,510 --> 00:26:40,290
they can

368
00:26:40,310 --> 00:26:41,380
just frame them for a crime

369
00:26:42,720 --> 00:26:43,900
and none of them will be spared.

370
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:46,420
The pivotal information in this matter

371
00:26:47,550 --> 00:26:49,140
is that Luo Ang genuinely wants to save you.

372
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,770
If you live,

373
00:26:53,240 --> 00:26:54,730
the Mystic Nine can live.

374
00:26:56,030 --> 00:26:56,900
Our followers

375
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:57,900
who rely on us

376
00:26:57,920 --> 00:26:58,980
to fill their tummies can live.

377
00:27:01,350 --> 00:27:02,090
That's why

378
00:27:03,070 --> 00:27:04,530
I must help the Ministry of War

379
00:27:05,310 --> 00:27:07,180
eliminate the other masters

380
00:27:07,270 --> 00:27:08,280
in the Mystic Nine

381
00:27:08,280 --> 00:27:09,460
and take over the Mystic Nine myself.

382
00:27:11,750 --> 00:27:12,490
Then,

383
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:15,090
the outcome is set in stone.

384
00:27:15,590 --> 00:27:16,490
This

385
00:27:17,030 --> 00:27:18,860
has always been my fight.

386
00:27:19,640 --> 00:27:21,020
I shouldn't have dragged all of you in.

387
00:27:21,070 --> 00:27:22,010
It's my fight.

388
00:27:22,070 --> 00:27:22,810
Not yours!

389
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:23,530
By your fight,

390
00:27:23,550 --> 00:27:24,810
you mean to sacrifice yourself?

391
00:27:25,440 --> 00:27:25,730
Fine.

392
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:27,490
So you're sacrificed.

393
00:27:27,590 --> 00:27:29,010
We can leave Changsha safely.

394
00:27:29,110 --> 00:27:30,330
Do you think we can survive?

395
00:27:30,440 --> 00:27:31,180
Do you think

396
00:27:31,240 --> 00:27:32,420
the Ministry of War will spare us?

397
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:37,050
You still have time.

398
00:27:38,590 --> 00:27:39,730
If you leave now,

399
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:41,010
you can still live.

400
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:41,940
Master Zhang!

401
00:27:42,830 --> 00:27:44,050
Why can't you understand this?

402
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:46,140
Xie Jiu,

403
00:27:46,440 --> 00:27:47,330
Xiaoyu, and I

404
00:27:47,640 --> 00:27:49,140
are trying to save you.

405
00:27:49,310 --> 00:27:50,290
It's not about your life.

406
00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:52,010
We are trying to save Changsha!

407
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,180
You have a war to fight.

408
00:27:55,200 --> 00:27:56,530
You have to protect Changsha, Master Zhang.

409
00:27:58,270 --> 00:27:59,700
Time has changed.

410
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:02,180
The Mystic Nine is no longer needed,

411
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:02,860
Master Zhang.

412
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:09,460
I

413
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:10,660
finally come to this realization.

414
00:28:12,680 --> 00:28:13,860
The Monkey King is powerful,

415
00:28:16,070 --> 00:28:16,940
but he's still

416
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:18,380
just a rabble-rousing monkey.

417
00:28:19,070 --> 00:28:20,290
He wreaks havoc in the Heavenly Palace,

418
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:22,140
but he can't make a new one.

419
00:28:25,590 --> 00:28:26,570
But you can.

420
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:28,900
You can set up new rules.

421
00:28:29,000 --> 00:28:29,940
You can protect our land

422
00:28:30,070 --> 00:28:31,140
and our people.

423
00:28:31,200 --> 00:28:32,770
So you must live!

424
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:41,770
Kill me.

425
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:45,380
Put an end to the whole Mystic Nine saga.

426
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:47,420
Our people will live in peace.

427
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,010
Kill me.

428
00:28:58,480 --> 00:28:59,010
No.

429
00:29:18,350 --> 00:29:19,330
If I

430
00:29:22,750 --> 00:29:24,330
hadn't dragged you into the Otherworld Tower,

431
00:29:25,790 --> 00:29:27,460
you would still have been the carefree Fifth Master.

432
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:29,810
It's all

433
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:32,180
my fault.

434
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:34,530
I shouldn't have involved you.

435
00:29:40,440 --> 00:29:41,220
There's no turning back.

436
00:29:44,310 --> 00:29:45,770
Let me make the decision for you.

437
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:55,220
Soon, the newspaper will say

438
00:29:56,830 --> 00:29:58,490
the head of the Mystic Nine, Wu Laogou,

439
00:29:59,920 --> 00:30:01,700
captured and killed the Defense Commander's

440
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,660
Communication Officer.

441
00:30:04,550 --> 00:30:06,460
Then, he tried to assassinate the Defense Commander

442
00:30:06,550 --> 00:30:07,810
to start a riot.

443
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:10,180
That crime

444
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:13,220
is enough to have me killed thrice.

445
00:30:15,110 --> 00:30:15,810
Don't do that.

446
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:49,770
He can cry.

447
00:30:50,790 --> 00:30:51,490
But why are you crying?

448
00:30:52,310 --> 00:30:53,140
Are you going to miss me?

449
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:03,180
Bring it on.

450
00:31:04,350 --> 00:31:05,250
Forgive me.

451
00:31:12,580 --> 00:31:16,880
[Wu Laogou turned on his own and assassinated government officials]

452
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:21,260
[Master Zhang captured the murderer to protect the city]

453
00:31:26,270 --> 00:31:26,860
Qishan.

454
00:31:27,510 --> 00:31:28,250
Well done.

455
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:31,860
You are the reason why we could quell

456
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,660
the riot of the Mystic Nine.

457
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:40,330
I declare this case an attempt to incite a riot.

458
00:31:41,160 --> 00:31:42,140
The evidence is clear.

459
00:31:43,270 --> 00:31:44,140
According to the military order,

460
00:31:44,350 --> 00:31:45,380
he has to be publicly executed

461
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:46,460
to serve as a warning to others.

462
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:50,810
This will demonstrate our strict disciplines

463
00:31:51,880 --> 00:31:53,180
and reassure the people.

464
00:31:57,590 --> 00:31:58,490
Sign it.

465
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:00,620
Carry out the execution

466
00:32:01,110 --> 00:32:02,220
tomorrow at the hour of Wu.

467
00:32:02,220 --> 00:32:05,220
[Judgment]

468
00:32:16,790 --> 00:32:17,980
I will supervise it personally

469
00:32:19,310 --> 00:32:20,460
to make sure nothing goes wrong.

470
00:32:22,500 --> 00:32:27,860
[Changsha Defense Commander Zhang Qishan]

471
00:32:30,740 --> 00:32:31,660
[Open Execution for Policy Correction]

472
00:32:42,660 --> 00:32:46,540
[Equality for People, Fair Administration]

473
00:33:58,680 --> 00:33:59,090
Master.

474
00:34:08,320 --> 00:34:09,490
Sorry, my friends.

475
00:34:11,230 --> 00:34:12,050
I dragged you into this.

476
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:13,340
Master.

477
00:34:14,230 --> 00:34:15,460
What are you talking about?

478
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,610
You gave us our lives.

479
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:19,980
To die with you,

480
00:34:20,550 --> 00:34:21,130
it's worth it.

481
00:34:22,800 --> 00:34:24,210
With all of you next to me,

482
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,460
my trip to the afterlife will be a lively one.

483
00:34:26,510 --> 00:34:27,780
Perhaps even the ghosts

484
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,610
will be afraid of us.

485
00:34:29,670 --> 00:34:30,010
That's right.

486
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:30,940
Master.

487
00:34:31,510 --> 00:34:32,690
You are the Monkey King.

488
00:34:33,760 --> 00:34:34,780
In the Underworld,

489
00:34:35,360 --> 00:34:36,860
we'll do something great together.

490
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:38,900
We'll beat up the little imps,

491
00:34:39,670 --> 00:34:41,490
and fight our way back to the Heavenly Palace.

492
00:34:41,670 --> 00:34:42,380
That's right!

493
00:34:42,590 --> 00:34:43,380
Master!

494
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:45,420
We will die with you!

495
00:34:51,670 --> 00:34:52,300
Good.

496
00:35:20,630 --> 00:35:22,010
Wu and his cohort of thugs

497
00:35:22,550 --> 00:35:23,570
possessed illegal arms,

498
00:35:23,840 --> 00:35:24,820
murdered government officials,

499
00:35:25,110 --> 00:35:26,090
and disrupted the societal peace.

500
00:35:26,490 --> 00:35:27,550
[Judgment]
They are found guilty of their crimes.

501
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:30,170
In accordance with Section 16 of the Criminal Code of Armed Forces

502
00:35:30,710 --> 00:35:32,690
and Section 2 of the Bandits Regulations Ordinance,

503
00:35:33,320 --> 00:35:34,340
they will be sentenced to death

504
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:35,650
immediately.

505
00:35:44,630 --> 00:35:45,900
Can I talk to him?

506
00:36:16,670 --> 00:36:17,260
Laogou.

507
00:36:20,710 --> 00:36:21,570
Any last words?

508
00:36:24,360 --> 00:36:25,900
I knew this day would come.

509
00:36:32,510 --> 00:36:34,170
I thought I could change my fate

510
00:36:36,550 --> 00:36:37,570
if you left the Mystic Nine.

511
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:42,090
In the end,

512
00:36:43,670 --> 00:36:44,130
I still

513
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:47,530
couldn't escape

514
00:36:47,550 --> 00:36:48,740
your control.

515
00:36:51,110 --> 00:36:52,210
Your shackles

516
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:54,050
did not come from me,

517
00:36:56,360 --> 00:36:57,340
but you.

518
00:36:58,060 --> 00:37:01,460
♪Recognizing you through the smoke of war♪

519
00:37:04,590 --> 00:37:06,010
Can I ask for one last favor from you?

520
00:37:07,630 --> 00:37:08,900
That nobody

521
00:37:09,590 --> 00:37:10,780
has no right to take my life.

522
00:37:13,030 --> 00:37:14,090
We know each other so well.

523
00:37:16,320 --> 00:37:16,900
Master Zhang.

524
00:37:17,940 --> 00:37:21,100
♪You sit in your lone city while I protect my hometown♪

525
00:37:21,110 --> 00:37:21,900
Send me off.

526
00:37:22,900 --> 00:37:27,260
♪I dip my brush into the western wind to paint the setting sun♪

527
00:37:27,580 --> 00:37:31,940
♪The returning ravens are too noisy, how can I fight back?♪

528
00:37:32,860 --> 00:37:37,220
♪The land turns barren and old, the memories come flooding back♪

529
00:37:37,540 --> 00:37:42,380
♪Every moment with you appears in my heart♪

530
00:37:42,740 --> 00:37:47,340
♪My burning heart turns ashen, my hair turns white♪

531
00:37:47,780 --> 00:37:52,540
♪I look at you whilst I yearn for you♪

532
00:37:52,820 --> 00:37:57,220
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

533
00:37:57,580 --> 00:38:02,340
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

534
00:38:02,700 --> 00:38:07,300
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty♪

535
00:38:07,660 --> 00:38:13,700
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

536
00:38:37,940 --> 00:38:41,180
♪Holding a pool of autumn water, we share the same robe♪

537
00:38:41,190 --> 00:38:41,900
Sir.

538
00:38:42,510 --> 00:38:44,300
Wu and his cohorts have been executed.

539
00:38:49,880 --> 00:38:50,780
From now on,

540
00:38:51,630 --> 00:38:53,300
hunt down the Mystic Nine.

541
00:38:54,070 --> 00:38:55,530
It shall not rise again.

542
00:38:57,780 --> 00:39:02,140
♪The land is barren, the snow is thick, the longing is endless♪

543
00:39:02,460 --> 00:39:07,300
♪Thousand miles apart, with whom are you enjoying the good moments?♪

544
00:39:07,660 --> 00:39:12,260
♪It's just a dream, it's just my duty♪

545
00:39:12,740 --> 00:39:17,740
♪Trading my life for your safety♪

546
00:39:17,760 --> 00:39:19,300
[20 Years Later]
My fellow audience,

547
00:39:19,440 --> 00:39:21,340
listen well.

548
00:39:21,590 --> 00:39:22,820
I shall tell you

549
00:39:23,920 --> 00:39:24,740
a story now.

550
00:39:25,800 --> 00:39:27,900
The tales of the martial arts world

551
00:39:28,030 --> 00:39:29,780
are like the moon.

552
00:39:30,030 --> 00:39:31,490
It's not full when you want it to be.

553
00:39:31,550 --> 00:39:33,780
It's crescent when you don't want it to be.

554
00:39:34,280 --> 00:39:35,010
As the saying goes,

555
00:39:35,550 --> 00:39:38,050
the raging tide of time

556
00:39:38,320 --> 00:39:40,460
will wash away different eras of heroes.

557
00:39:41,230 --> 00:39:42,170
Just like this,

558
00:39:42,880 --> 00:39:44,490
the prestigious Mystic Nine

559
00:39:44,710 --> 00:39:46,820
that once settled in here

560
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:48,380
is now left

561
00:39:48,440 --> 00:39:50,460
without even a plaque.

562
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:52,690
Some say that they were bandits.

563
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:53,740
Some say

564
00:39:53,920 --> 00:39:56,530
they were protectors of the people.

565
00:39:57,110 --> 00:39:58,820
Are they good or evil,

566
00:39:58,880 --> 00:39:59,780
a boon or a bane?

567
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:01,650
No one knows.

568
00:40:02,110 --> 00:40:04,170
It really shows us

569
00:40:04,630 --> 00:40:06,090
that as grand as the martial arts world can be,

570
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:10,940
no one can survive the changing of time.

571
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:15,130
So what happened to Master Zhang?

572
00:40:15,280 --> 00:40:16,530
Where did he go?

573
00:40:16,840 --> 00:40:17,740
I grew up here,

574
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:18,650
and I've never

575
00:40:18,710 --> 00:40:20,130
heard of a person called Master Zhang.

576
00:40:21,480 --> 00:40:22,490
And Wu Laogou

577
00:40:22,590 --> 00:40:24,170
died just like that?

578
00:40:24,440 --> 00:40:25,420
And Chen Pi

579
00:40:25,510 --> 00:40:26,940
is blind.

580
00:40:27,030 --> 00:40:28,610
How is he going to fight now?

581
00:40:29,480 --> 00:40:30,530
And Huo Xiangu,

582
00:40:30,760 --> 00:40:31,940
is anyone taking care of her?

583
00:40:32,150 --> 00:40:33,650
She's a prideful woman.

584
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:35,570
She won't just lie on the bed all her life.

585
00:40:35,840 --> 00:40:36,860
And what about Qi Tiezui?

586
00:40:37,110 --> 00:40:38,740
Isn't he a seer?

587
00:40:38,960 --> 00:40:40,570
He didn't predict the bad outcome?

588
00:40:43,840 --> 00:40:45,050
All right. All right.

589
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:47,900
You sure have a lot of questions.

590
00:40:48,230 --> 00:40:49,980
But there are certain things

591
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:51,650
in this world

592
00:40:51,800 --> 00:40:53,740
that have no answer.

593
00:40:53,960 --> 00:40:54,940
Some of them

594
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:57,300
become legends.

595
00:40:57,710 --> 00:40:58,490
That's all I know

596
00:40:58,510 --> 00:40:59,820
about the Mystic Nine.

597
00:41:00,230 --> 00:41:02,090
As to what happens later,

598
00:41:02,400 --> 00:41:05,010
I have no idea.

599
00:41:05,880 --> 00:41:06,260
Anyway,

600
00:41:06,630 --> 00:41:07,260
look.

601
00:41:07,480 --> 00:41:08,780
It's getting late.

602
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:10,380
Go back home and eat.

603
00:41:10,590 --> 00:41:11,940
If you want more stories,

604
00:41:12,110 --> 00:41:14,490
come here again tomorrow.

605
00:41:14,510 --> 00:41:15,300
All right.

606
00:41:26,880 --> 00:41:28,130
They already went back.

607
00:41:28,280 --> 00:41:29,610
Why are you still here?

608
00:41:30,030 --> 00:41:31,530
I don't like this story.

609
00:41:32,030 --> 00:41:33,010
The Mystic Nine

610
00:41:33,030 --> 00:41:34,300
shouldn't end like this.

611
00:41:35,400 --> 00:41:36,050
Sir,

612
00:41:36,920 --> 00:41:38,050
are you telling

613
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:39,780
a true story,

614
00:41:40,070 --> 00:41:41,610
or did you make it up?

615
00:41:42,440 --> 00:41:43,740
If you made it up,

616
00:41:44,840 --> 00:41:45,780
can you...

617
00:41:46,190 --> 00:41:47,490
Can you change the ending?

618
00:41:47,710 --> 00:41:49,050
Let them live.

619
00:41:49,360 --> 00:41:50,690
Master Zhang won't leave.

620
00:41:50,880 --> 00:41:52,170
Wu Laogou won't die.

621
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:53,690
They drink and eat

622
00:41:53,760 --> 00:41:54,740
together,

623
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:56,050
and have a good time.

624
00:42:15,940 --> 00:42:20,100
♪The past fades like smoke♪

625
00:42:20,460 --> 00:42:23,180
♪A choice is made in silence♪

626
00:42:23,460 --> 00:42:26,260
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

627
00:42:26,660 --> 00:42:30,420
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

628
00:42:30,660 --> 00:42:34,100
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

629
00:42:34,380 --> 00:42:37,780
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

630
00:42:37,860 --> 00:42:45,140
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

631
00:42:45,580 --> 00:42:48,860
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

632
00:42:49,140 --> 00:42:52,380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

633
00:42:52,540 --> 00:42:56,580
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

634
00:42:56,780 --> 00:43:00,140
♪Who believes in fate?♪

635
00:43:00,380 --> 00:43:03,740
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

636
00:43:03,980 --> 00:43:07,260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

637
00:43:07,580 --> 00:43:11,260
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

638
00:43:11,460 --> 00:43:14,700
♪Take care♪

639
00:43:14,700 --> 00:43:17,260
♪We once raced♪

640
00:43:17,340 --> 00:43:19,260
♪For the dawn♪

641
00:43:19,420 --> 00:43:22,700
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

642
00:43:22,820 --> 00:43:26,100
♪In the web of fate♪

643
00:43:26,100 --> 00:43:29,300
♪No one can escape♪

644
00:43:30,300 --> 00:43:32,140
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

645
00:43:32,300 --> 00:43:33,860
♪We too were young once♪

646
00:43:33,940 --> 00:43:37,380
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

647
00:43:37,580 --> 00:43:39,900
♪Keep the ember lit♪

648
00:43:40,020 --> 00:43:44,540
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

649
00:43:44,660 --> 00:43:47,620
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

650
00:43:47,860 --> 00:43:51,380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

651
00:43:51,500 --> 00:43:55,260
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

652
00:43:55,580 --> 00:43:59,060
♪Who believes in fate?♪

653
00:43:59,220 --> 00:44:02,220
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

654
00:44:02,460 --> 00:44:06,220
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

655
00:44:06,380 --> 00:44:10,100
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

656
00:44:10,220 --> 00:44:21,660
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
